  "prefLabel": "Arch 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson. The chairperson shall preside at all meetings. In the absence of the chairperson, the vice-chairperson shall preside.\n\nSource. #7942, eff 8-27-03",
